# =========================================================================
# Z9 Automotive Mobile App — Cloud Configuration
# =========================================================================
# Follow these steps to connect your Supabase Cloud project:
# 1. Sign up / log in to https://supabase.com and create a new project.
# 2. Go to Project Settings -> API and copy your Project URL and anon public API Key.
# 3. Create a Storage Bucket named: "inspection-photos"
#    - Set bucket to "Public bucket" so report viewers can view evidence photos.
# 4. Copy this file to '.env' and fill in the values below:

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key-here
